{"Making `teamId` optional in `InsightsBookingServicePublicOptions` allows `scope: \"team\"` calls to compile without a `teamId`. At runtime `safeParse` will fail and the service will silently return `NOTHING_CONDITION`, which can mask bugs and lead to empty results with no signal. Should make `teamId` required when `scope` is `\"team\"` using a discriminated union matching `insightsBookingServiceOptionsSchema`, or keep the constructor parameter typed as `InsightsBookingServiceOptions` and throw on invalid options.": 0.9236606955528259}